  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - On 27 June 2023, the proposal as shown on the submitted material [Drawings SP01, PL01, EL01, EL02 and MH/127/2023/B, Planning Statement (dated January 2025) and four sworn declarations (dated 12/12/2024, 12/12/2024, 18/12/2024 and 20/12/2024), received 07/02/2025. Lawyer's letter (dated 16/07/2025), three sworn declarations (dated 18/07/2025, 18/07/2025 and 21/07/2025) and Appendices 1-5, received 25/07/2025] was lawful because:\n\nThe application has successfully demonstrated that, on the balance of probabilities, a lawful C4 HMO use existed at the site prior to the Council's HMOs Article 4 Direction coming into force on 4th September 2023. The application therefore complies with the requirements of Schedule 2, Part 3, Class L of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended), and a Certificate can be granted."
